  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mariko 12",
  "verseCount": 44,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ageca kwoŋ jofur i ndelo vini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.5.1+ISA.5.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 5:1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yesu ocako luwo rijo g'agecin ni: “Dhano moro opidho yen vini i ndelo, othoko ndelo no gi cel, okunyo bur ma biyo vini to gero ot acurcur ma kur. Go oketho ndelo vini i cingi jofur moro to kadho wiloka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ndir otundo ma fono vini, go ooro ŋeca pere bongi jofur pere no ni jowolimi rigo gim'onyak moro wok i vini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jofur no jomako ŋeca no jogoyo, to joriemo go ma bu gimoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo won ndelo ooro ŋeca man; ma bende jofur jogoyo lero to jofuta go swa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Won ndelo ooro ŋeca man, to joneko meno; jotimo ŋecin man mathoth ameno, munyo jogoyo jomegi aka joneko joman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋat'onwaŋo odoŋ aora bongi jofur oyido obedo wode won ma migos. Am'omiyo rumacen ooro wode won gipi bongi jofur ka waco ni, ‘Adieri jobino woro wodan.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jofur no jowaco wegi kendi gin ni, ‘Me won a musika pa won ndelo, weyi waneki go aka waŋati walunji lim pere!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jomako go to joneko, to jobolo delkwoŋe woko ma ndelo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu openjo ni, onyo won ndelo no otim aŋo? Kole go bino neko woko jofur mareco no to ketho ndelo i cingi jofur man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.118.22+PSA.118.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 118:22-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fodi wikisoma i ndiko ma waco ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotel pa Joyuda jotemo mako Yesu, rupiri joŋeyo ni go oyido obolo ageca me kwoŋ jo. To jolworo lwak ji, am'omiyo joweyo go to jokadho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fonji kwoŋ goyo misolo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jooro Jofarisayo moro kodi jopa Herode bongi Yesu ciko go i luwo pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobino bonge to jowaco ni, “Jafonji, waŋeyo ni ibedo ŋat'otire, aka ikilwori nyatoro; ikidew kwoŋ dwoŋ pa nyatoro, to ifonjo gir'adieri kwoŋ gima Were yenyo ri dhano ayino. Ere waci riwan; yere i Cik mawan goyo misolo ri Kayisar, kosa be?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu oneno apondi pajo to dwoko ni, “Raŋo ma witemo ciko an? Keli win pesa moro anen.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokelo rigo pesa m'othedhi acel to penjo jo ni, “Me cal pa ŋa kodi nyingi ŋa man kwoŋe me?” Jodwoko go ni, “Apa Kayisar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yesu owaco ni, “am'omiyo miy win Kayisar gipa Kayisar, aka wimiy Were bende gipa Were.” Aka joje jouro go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Penji kwoŋ cerino pa jom'otho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.23.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 23:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josadukayo moro ma jowaco ni cerino pa jom'otho ongoye jobino bongi Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.25.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 25:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowaco ni, “Jafonji, Musa cango ondiko riwan cik me ni, ‘Ka dhano otho oweyo cege, to k'olimo nyithindho, omin ŋato ripo lunjo citho no, to limo nyithindho ri jatho.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndelo moro obedo wutmere abirio. Kayo pajo onywomo, to tho ma k'olimo nyithindho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mar'ario olunjo dheno to bende tho to weyo go ma bu nyathi. Mar'adek bende ameno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jom'odoŋ bende ameno. Wutmere abirio je jobedo gi dhako no aka jotho ma jok'olimo nyithindho. Rumacen to dhako no bende tho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo ceŋ ka jom'otho je jocerino, dhako no obedi apa ŋa? Ato cwo abirio no je jobedo gi dhako no!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwoko jo ni, “Me k'agima miyo wikomi, ma wikuya Ndiko Maleŋ kosa meni pa Were? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ka jom'otho jocerino jobino cale gi jomalaika man polo, aka cwo gi mon jokibino nywomere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 3:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ma mako kwoŋ cerino pa jom'otho, fodi wikisoma i kitawo pa Musa, bol ma luwo kwoŋ kasugu ma waŋ? Ondiki kenyo paka Were owaco ri Musa ni, ‘Abedo Were pa Abraham, Were pa Isaka, kodi Were pa Yakobo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwoŋ mere ni go obedo Were pa jomakwo, makiweno apa jom'otho. Wipodho swa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Or madwoŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jandiko moro onwaŋo nikenyo winjo luwo no. Go oneno ni Yesu oyido dwoko Josadukayo maber am'omiyo obino bonge gi penji me ni, “Or mene maloyo Or je gi dwoŋ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.4+DEU.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 6:4-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwoko go ni, “Me a marapena: ‘Joisiraili winji win! Rwoth Were mawan a Were; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka iripo maro Rwoth Were perin g'adundo perin je, gi cunyin je, gi paro perin je, gi meni perin je.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 19:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mar'ario ma luwo meno gi dwoŋ a me: ‘Mari nyawotin paka iwon imare.’ Ongoye Or man maloyo ario me.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 4:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jandiki Cik owaco ri Yesu ni, “Itire, Jafonji; Itire i waco ni Rwoth a Were kende, aka ongoye Were man kwanyo woko go; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.6.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 6:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka dhano ripo maro go g'adundo pere je, gi paro pere je, gi meni pere je, gi maro nyawote paka won omare. Winjo Or ario me loyo tero ri Were cowirok awaŋa ma le kodi giman je.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.10.25+LUK.10.26+LUK.10.27+LUK.10.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 10:25-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu oneno ni dwoki pere nyutho rieko to waco rigo ni, “Onyo ikibor gi Ker pa Were.” Rumacen moro k'odoko otemo penjo Yesu wac moro je.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Penji kwoŋ Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yesu fonjo i Ot pa Were openjo ni, “Jondiko jonyalo nedi waco ni Kristo obedo wod pa Daudi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.110.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 110:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole munyo Cuny Maleŋ oloro ri Daudi won owaco ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gwoko kwoŋ jofonji cik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak ji jowinjo Yesu gi kisangala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo go fonjo ji owaco ni, “Kure win kwoŋ jondiko, ma jomaro nyumo gi nangin mabeyo nike womothi jo gi dwoŋ i katale; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "joyero kombere mabeyo loyo i kitipa pa jom'oyeyo pa Joyuda kodi kabedo pa wendo awora i kalima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jomayo mon tho udi pajo aka joyumere gi kwayo maboyo. Gir'acula pajo bino raco tektek!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mic pa citho moro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu obedo piny cegin gi sanduku ma kano pesa, aka oneno paka ji mathoth jobol'iye pesa pajo. Jom'oŋaŋ mathoth jobolo pesa kweth; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gikenyo citho moro ma jacandi bende obino to bol'iye nusu pesa nyaka ario won mathindho thindho marom gi dome acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yesu olwoŋo jofonjirok pere bonge to waco rijo ni, “Adieri awaco riwin, citho ma jacandi me obolo i sanduku mic mathoth loyo apa joman je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rupiri dhano je omiyo pesa wok kwoŋ lim m'onwaŋo go nitie gine, to theno gi candi pere omiyo gimoro je m'onwaŋo d'okwo gine.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
